WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.897 --> 00:00:14.521
Kid 1: Hey, we were playing with that ball!

2
00:00:14.541 --> 00:00:16.642
Danny: Come on, come all!

3
00:00:17.263 --> 00:00:19.964
Gather round for a story that will amaze you!

4
00:00:19.984 --> 00:00:22.205
Kid 2: What is he talking about?

5
00:00:22.225 --> 00:00:28.568
Danny: This is the incredible tale of Danny and the Colorless Giants!

6
00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:34.261
Brad: Uh-oh.

7
00:00:35.022 --> 00:00:39.886
Danny: Once upon a time, there was an evil giant named Tristay.

8
00:00:40.246 --> 00:00:42.188
Tina: Danny, be quiet!

9
00:00:42.648 --> 00:00:46.132
Danny: A friendly giant named Hopian came to me.

10
00:00:46.272 --> 00:00:50.295
Danny: He asked me to save his world from the evil Tristay!

11
00:00:50.315 --> 00:00:56.060
Tina: Danny, we made a promise not to talk about it.

12
00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:58.222
Brad: People will laugh at us.

13
00:00:58.282 --> 00:00:59.704
Danny: No, they won't.

14
00:01:00.312 --> 00:01:01.833
They'll think we are heroes.

15
00:01:01.853 --> 00:01:04.075
Kids: We want a story.

16
00:01:04.335 --> 00:01:05.416
We want a story.

17
00:01:05.496 --> 00:01:11.161
Danny: I magically traveled to a strange world.

18
00:01:11.181 --> 00:01:16.746
Danny: I survived dangerous waters, freezing cold, and a horrible monster.

19
00:01:16.766 --> 00:01:19.869
Chuck: Do you believe this guy?

20
00:01:19.889 --> 00:01:22.511
Dave: I think we should shut him up.

21
00:01:23.792 --> 00:01:27.635
Danny: Then, using my powerful imagination Tina: Danny!

22
00:01:27.855 --> 00:01:30.205
Stop! Chuck: Ha-ha!

23
00:01:30.825 --> 00:01:33.227
Even your girlfriend doesn't believe you.

24
00:01:33.247 --> 00:01:36.189
Dave: You should stop making up stories.

25
00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:39.131
Tina: Remember last time?

26
00:01:39.151 --> 00:01:43.614
Chuck: We're not scared.

27
00:01:44.275 --> 00:01:45.616
It’s two against one.

28
00:01:45.636 --> 00:01:46.857
Dave: Yeah.

29
00:01:47.477 --> 00:01:49.939
Your friends are too scared to fight us.

30
00:01:49.959 --> 00:01:52.441
Danny: I’m not scared.

31
00:01:53.101 --> 00:01:55.603
I defeated the evil giant Tristay!

32
00:01:58.137 --> 00:02:03.780
Dave: That's for telling lies!

33
00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:06.661
Danny: I was not telling lies!

34
00:02:06.681 --> 00:02:10.183
Dave: You never traveled to a magic world.

35
00:02:10.203 --> 00:02:13.425
Chuck: And you didn't fight an evil giant.

36
00:02:13.465 --> 00:02:16.767
Danny: I did!

37
00:02:17.107 --> 00:02:18.547
You can ask these two!

38
00:02:18.567 --> 00:02:22.450
Dave: So?

39
00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:23.890
Is he telling the truth?

40
00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.612
Chuck: Yes, is he telling the truth?

41
00:02:30.892 --> 00:02:31.492
Danny: Fine!

42
00:02:31.672 --> 00:02:33.313
If you won’t tell them, I will.

43
00:02:33.333 --> 00:02:38.735
Danny: It's true.

44
00:02:39.015 --> 00:02:41.716
I defeated an evil giant with magic powers.

45
00:02:41.736 --> 00:02:42.937
Kid 1: How?

46
00:02:42.957 --> 00:02:45.458
Danny: My imagination was the key.

47
00:02:45.478 --> 00:02:49.860
Danny: At one point, we had to fight a giant dragonfly!

48
00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:52.541
Kid 3: Wow.

49
00:02:52.601 --> 00:02:56.842
Tina: Come on, Danny.

50
00:02:56.862 --> 00:02:57.543
Let's go.

51
00:02:57.563 --> 00:02:58.863
Danny: No.

52
00:02:59.363 --> 00:03:00.484
They love this story.

53
00:03:01.172 --> 00:03:02.353
And I'm going to tell it.

54
00:03:02.373 --> 00:03:04.074
Brad: We warned you.

55
00:03:04.094 --> 00:03:10.559
Danny: The dragonfly attacked us near a blue stream.

56
00:03:10.579 --> 00:03:25.090
Danny: We hid underwater, holding our breath Ha-ha!

57
00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:27.852
That's what you get for telling tales!

58
00:03:28.764 --> 00:03:29.324
Dave: Yeah.

59
00:03:29.565 --> 00:03:32.046
You're not brave enough to save anybody!

60
00:03:32.066 --> 00:03:36.669
Chuck: What do you want?

61
00:03:36.689 --> 00:03:38.970
Brad: What you did wasn't nice.

62
00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:40.511
Dave: So what?

63
00:03:40.972 --> 00:03:42.633
What can you do about it?

64
00:03:42.653 --> 00:03:45.534
Brad: I’ll get even with you.

65
00:03:46.155 --> 00:03:47.716
Some day, somehow!
